\Delta G & = \int_{V_1}^{V_2} P dV \\
& = \int_{V_1}^{V_2} \frac{\begin{smallmatrix}\text{constant}\\ \text{pressure}\end{smallmatrix}}{1 + \beta P}\ dV \\
& = \frac{1}{1 + \beta P} \int_{V_1}^{V_2} P dV \\
& = \frac{1}{1 + \beta P} \left[ \frac{P^2}{2} \right]_{V_1}^{V_2}.
\end{align*}
Let's plug in the given values: \begin{align*}
