\left[ \frac{(3000 \ kg \ cm^{-2} \times 9.8 \ m \ s^{-2})^2}{2} \right] - \frac{1}{1 } \left[ \frac{(0 \ kg \ cm^{-2})^2}{2} \right] \\
& \approx  \boxed{5100 \ Nm/mole}.
